ext": "不再有爱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1210.07, "timestamp": "00:20:10", "text": "我不知道。 我现在只是在胡乱按键"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1212.71, "timestamp": "00:20:12", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1215.43, "timestamp": "00:20:15", "text": "我现在只是在胡乱按键"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1254.07, "timestamp": "00:20:54", "text": "。 我们应该去看看那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1276.07, "timestamp": "00:21:16", "text": "这是什么？ 这是谁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1300.87, "timestamp": "00:21:40", "text": "这些位置在地图上哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1308.23, "timestamp": "00:21:48", "text": "服务。 正确的。 好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1310.63, "timestamp": "00:21:50", "text": "一切从这里开始。 两个专门"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1315.27, "timestamp": "00:21:55", "text": "为皮诺设计的假人将陪伴"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1318.31, "timestamp": "00:21:58", "text": "奥克塔维亚。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1320.549, "timestamp": "00:22:00", "text": "嗯，哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1323.909, "timestamp": "00:22:03", "text": "对了，Alex，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1325.83, "timestamp": "00:22:05", "text": "完成神秘任务帕里斯姆后，你就会再次……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1334.87, "timestamp": "00:22:14", "text": "想象一下，如果你相信的话，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1337.909, "timestamp": "00:22:17", "text": "在这个宇宙中还存在着一个完全不同的世界。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1339.27, "timestamp": "00:22:19", "text": "我打算花一整天时间。 小心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1341.35, "timestamp": "00:22:21", "text": "你好。 小心。 感谢您的光临，祝您"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1343.59, "timestamp": "00:22:23", "text": "工作顺利。 极乐[音乐]，如同"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1346.07, "timestamp": "00:22:26", "text": "清醒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1347.669, "timestamp": "00:22:27", "text": "梦境一般。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1350.31, "timestamp": "00:22:30", "text": "现实变得模糊不清，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1353.83, "timestamp": "00:22:33", "text": "或者说，被重新定义了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1355.59, "timestamp": "00:22:35", "text": "但是，在他们完美无瑕的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1358.63, "timestamp": "00:22:38", "text": "现实世界之外，物质世界的问题依然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1361.35, "timestamp": "00:22:41", "text": "存在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1364.549, "timestamp": "00:22:44", "text": "最终，他们逃离的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1367.75, "timestamp": "00:22:47", "text": "现实世界中，残酷的真相还是追上了他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1370.71, "timestamp": "00:22:50", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1371.43, "timestamp": "00:22:51", "text": "嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1374.39, "timestamp": "00:22:54", "text": "在黑暗的废墟深处，另一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1376.16, "timestamp": "00:22:56", "text": "逃离毁灭的灵魂发现了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1380.789, "timestamp": "00:23:00", "text": "[音乐]这个世界最后的遗迹。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1382.71, "timestamp": "00:23:02", "text": "这两个终端曾经是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1384.47, "timestamp": "00:23:04", "text": "梦想家们通过音乐与"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1385.35, "timestamp": "00:23:05", "text": "外界沟通的途径。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1386.149, "timestamp": "00:23:06", "text": "梦想家。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1388.31, "timestamp": "00:23:08", "text": "现在它们已成为该杂志音乐"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1389.83, "timestamp": "00:23:09", "text": "收藏的一部分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1392.31, "timestamp": "00:23:12", "text": "这位法师曾试图用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1393.846, "timestamp": "00:23:13", "text": "她从自己丰富多彩的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1396.23, "timestamp": "00:23:16", "text": "音乐经历中汲取的灵感来创造一个世界。 但作为一名冷静的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1398.87, "timestamp": "00:23:18", "text": "观察者，她始终没有找到那份"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1400.63, "timestamp": "00:23:20", "text": "灵感火花（音乐），将一切融合"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1403.59, "timestamp": "00:23:23", "text": "在一起。 在命运追上这位"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1406.549, "timestamp": "00:23:26", "text": "流浪的魔法师之前，她最后一次拜访了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1409.99, "timestamp": "00:23:29", "text": "她那